{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# Combatants｜结构图\n外置 ASC 宿主的最小共同契约。[[Combatants/结构|结构文档]] · 玩家 [[Teams/结构]] · Boss [[BossAI/结构]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1530,"height":130,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"base","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOCombatantState\n持ASC／属性集；Avatar选择／复制（AvatarPawn）及当前Avatar的OnEndPlay/OnDestroyed订阅归Host。\nAttachAvatar(Pawn) → BindAvatar → EGGYGOAvatarBindResult；OnRep_AvatarPawn走同一流程。\n绑定进行中再请求 → Reentrant；同一Pawn → AlreadyBound；宿主关闭/Pawn无效/宿主死亡/已绑别处 → 拒绝。\n释放旧：取消能力（保留SurvivesDeath）→ 清输入 → 移除Cue → Owner-only（关闭时ClearActorInfo）→ Released。\n绑定新：InitAbilityActorInfo(this, Pawn) → Extension广播Ready。\nDestroyed/EndPlay关闭生命周期并释放当前Avatar。","x":530,"y":300,"width":470,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"attr","type":"text","text":"## ASC／HealthSet／CombatSet\nHost默认子对象；ActorInfo只经原生Init/ClearActorInfo，ASC覆盖中清输入。\n组件GetOwner固定Host；活跃Host无Avatar仍保留属性/GE/冷却/死亡Tag。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Avatar 绑定|ASC绑定]]","x":0,"y":320,"width":410,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"pawn","type":"text","text":"## APawn／PawnExtension\nHandleAbilitySystemBound(ASC) → 广播Ready；HandleAbilitySystemReleased → 先清资源再广播Released。\nFGGYGOLocalASCSubscription：订阅时回放Ready，重复Ready不回调，Released只给消费过同一资源的订阅；分发前复制订阅表。\n死亡销毁前经宿主接口ReleaseAvatarBinding(ExpectedAvatar)请求释放。\nHandleControllerChanged只RefreshAbilityActorInfo。\n[[Character/结构|本地订阅接口]]","x":1110,"y":320,"width":420,"height":350,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"slot","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOCharacterSlot\nPawnData 复制回调与 Authority 初始化共用幂等 ASC 规则配置；AbilitySet 仍只由 Authority 授予。[[Teams/结构]]","x":0,"y":790,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"health","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOHealthComponent\n自己订阅PawnExtension（游戏世界中OnRegister与BeginPlay各尝试一次），Ready时绑定HealthSet五委托。\nDeathState本地唯一；Dying/Dead单调投影，解绑不清Tag、不隐式复活。\n[[Character/结构|Health]]","x":530,"y":790,"width":470,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"boss","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossState\nBossDefinition 复制回调按初始形态 PawnData 幂等安装 ASC 规则；能力授予仍只由 Authority 执行。[[BossAI/结构]]","x":1110,"y":790,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"contract","type":"text","text":"## 绑定契约与验证边界\n绑定流程由Host编排，Lyra顺序：释放旧Avatar（Released在ActorInfo解除之后）→ Init新Pawn → Ready。\nASC不保存绑定事务、身份或发布记录；本地订阅者（Hero、CMC、Health、LocomotionFX）各自消费Ready/Released并清自己的资源。\n晚到的OnEndPlay/OnDestroyed只释放仍是当前绑定的Pawn；换人不重绑。\nNullRHI自动化已通过；PIE单机与最小联机未验。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Avatar 绑定|ASC]] · [[Combatants/结构#绑定与释放顺序|绑定与释放顺序]]","x":0,"y":1100,"width":1450,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"combatants-host-port","type":"text","text":"## IGGYGOAvatarBindingHostInterface\nReleaseAvatarBinding(ExpectedAvatar)：只在ExpectedAvatar仍是宿主当前Avatar时释放；已被替换的旧Pawn不处理。\nPawnExtension经它请求释放（死亡销毁前）。\n取得ASC走IAbilitySystemInterface，接口不再提供。\n[[Combatants/结构#关键接口与资源输入输出|接口]]","x":1720,"y":320,"width":540,"height":260,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"base","fromSide":"left","toNode":"attr","toSide":"right","label":"持有默认ASC／属性集；调用原生Init/ClearActorInfo"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"base","fromSide":"right","toNode":"pawn","toSide":"left","label":"绑定后通知Extension广播Ready／Released"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"slot","fromSide":"top","toNode":"base","toSide":"bottom","label":"继承最小宿主"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"boss","fromSide":"top","toNode":"base","toSide":"bottom","label":"继承最小宿主"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"pawn","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"health","toSide":"top","label":"Health自己订阅Extension的本地资源"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"health","fromSide":"left","toNode":"attr","toSide":"bottom","label":"仅当前Avatar向ASC投影死亡标签"},
		{"id":"combatants-implements-port","fromNode":"pawn","fromSide":"right","toNode":"combatants-host-port","toSide":"left","label":"Extension请求ReleaseAvatarBinding"}
	]
}
